WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two hands sit on a table. You can see one being touched and feel touch on the other.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In some laboratory conditions, the visible hand begins to feel as though it belongs to you.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers call this the rubber-hand illusion. But here's the distinction:
a remarkable observation is not a blank check for a different product.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 sells structured meditation audio. The seller describes
twelve levels and forty-eight recordings.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Whether it produces the advertised outcomes is a separate question.
Look at the evidence. Try a free routine.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Decide what you actually need before buying anything.
